      "created_at": "2015-10-27T20:34:54.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>KS backer, have been loving the print-n-play over the last week or so.  I have done some 1 spirit and 2 spirit games, trying to figure who I like the best.</p>\n<p>My first question is on the board setup.  Do you always play board A for 1 player, and board B for 2 player, or is it random?  I have always kept it constant, but I think it would be nice to mix it up, especially for 1-2 spirit games.</p>\n<p>Second, are there any planned updates to the print-n-play, especially with the revealed info such as the ocean spirit or the adversaries?</p>",
