      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/a8b319/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-10-28T19:11:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thanks for the quick replies!  I have a couple more questions:</p>\n<p>On a build, do the invaders need to have an explorer, or can a town/city build without one?  I have been requiring an explorer, but a reread of rules says differently.</p>\n<p>Some rules mention a “settlement”.  Is this an old name for a town?</p>\n<p>Also, I would love to get thunderspeaker on the board, and I was able to get everything from the gameplay video except a) where to start and b) the second choice for the voice power (slow cost zero, if invaders, 2 fear or …). I don’t want anyone in trouble, so if that is too much info that’s OK.</p>",
